# The hub project imports third-party Asset Store packs (Courtyard, Modern Office, warehouse kits).
# Their license does not allow redistributing the files, so ONLY our own code and settings are committed.
# Everything under Assets/ is ignored except the folders listed below.
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Editor/
!/Assets/Editor.meta
!/Assets/Scripts/
!/Assets/Scripts.meta
!/Assets/Settings/
!/Assets/Settings.meta
!/Assets/XR/
!/Assets/XR.meta
# Local scenes that reference third-party assets must never be committed
/Assets/Scenes/Local/
